  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of 2 Regional Hospitals Project in Thala and Dahmani, Tunisia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to the achievement of the objective of the Strategic Health Development Plan (SHDP, 2016-2020), which mainly aiming at strengthening the health system through the development of preventive and curative medicine, while reducing regional disparities. Specifically, the project will improve access to quality secondary healthcare services in the west region through the establishment of 2 type B regionals hospitals in Thala and Dahmani.</narrative>
  </description>
